Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:13:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Phase 1: deterministic simulator, tool registry, state
 generator, tests

- Simulator enforces workflow/state machine; policy violations (suspended vendor,
  budget overrun, expired quote, duplicates) go through for the oracle to judge
- Orders priced from quotes; sequential IDs (PO-0001, APR-0001) for reproducibility
- modify_order adjusts budget and invalidates approvals (incl. APPROVED POs);
  approval threshold enforced; discount capped at 10%, once per quote
- Tool registry: 17 tools with risk tiers + JSON schemas (adds dispute_invoice)
- Task loader + seeded initial-state generator; ProcurementEnv call wrapper

Replaces the earlier Phase 1 simulator (old create_purchase_order /
modify_order signatures) and removes its tests in tests/environment/,
which target that API; Phase 1 tests now live in tests/test_simulator.py.
